It helps _lots_ to be rich AND naive.

I sneaked into the cross aligned altar in Mines Town
with XP:1/18 and  22,774 zorkmids, I think it was,
courtesy of four rich ghosts and two shops
bankrupted by credit cloning encountered earlier,
and without yet bothering to bankrupt a single shop
in Mines Town. I lucked out a bit, the first
donation got 4 points of protection.

Here's where the fun part comes in: at the end of 56
donations including that first one, enough of the
"small chance of succeeding" donations had been
successful at garnering another point of protection,
my PC had a naked AC of AC:-5 (at T:5095, which is
fast for me reaching Mines Town).

Woot!!!

So much for the protection racket debunkers.

xanthian, due soon enough for the usual quick
demise, but with a hide like a rhinocerous in the
meantime.

